# Google ADK Time Agent

This project is an Agentic AI application built using Google AI Studio API.
The agent answers real-time global time questions using a tool function.

## Features
- Uses Google Gemini model
- Tool-based real-time API access
- Runs in VS Code terminal

## How to Run
1. Install dependencies
2. Set GOOGLE_API_KEY
3. Run agent.py

## Supported Cities
- Lahore
- Peshawar
- New York
